title: Rudolf Hilferding
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/HilferdingRudolf.jpg
face-image: img/portraits/HilferdingRudolf.jpg
view-if: hilferding_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Rudolf Hilferding

Hilferding is [? if chancellor = "Hilferding": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Hilferding": the current President and ?] an economist and a disciple of Karl Kautsky. Originating from Vienna, Austria, he trained as a medical doctor, but later became involved in Marxist economics as a discipline. He has been the lead ideologist of our party since the Heidelberg Program of 1925.

- @against_right_and_left
- @toleration
- @finance_ministry_
- @economic_policy_
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@against_right_and_left
title: Against Right and Left
subtitle: As a Centrist, Hilferding seeks to steer a course between the party's factions.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 5; advisor_action_time = time; center_strength += 10; left_strength -= 5; labor_strength -= 5; neorevisionist_strength -= 5; center_dissent -= 10

We have reduced the strength of the dissident factions in the party.

@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Hilferding supports cooperation with the bourgeois parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_toleration: The SPD is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions.

@finance_ministry_
title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: As Finance Minister, Hilferding can enact tax policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : SPD not in government: ?] [? if finance_minister_party != "SPD" : The SPD does not control the finance ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government == 1 and finance_minister_party == "SPD"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: fiscal_policy

@economic_policy_
title: Economic Policy
subtitle: As one of our foremost theorists, Hilferding has sway over our economic policy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : SPD not in government: ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "SPD" or (finance_minister_party != "SPD" and economic_minister_party != "SPD") : We do not have the necessary government ministers. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government == 1 and (economic_minister_party == "SPD")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_democracy_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_policy

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Hilferding can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Hilferding"
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Hilferding can make use of their position to further our goals.
view if: president == "Hilferding"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : We have already taken such action too recently. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have already taken such action too recently.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have already taken such action too recently.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have already taken such action too recently.
go-to: reichsexekution
